 The app package now delegates shared input validation to the core package. The existing core
 package already imports the app package for its event sink. No development dependencies changed.
+
+## Changes
+
+### Interface changes
+
+None.
+
+### Behavior changes
+
+`@example/app` now delegates shared input validation to `@example/core`. Its workspace runtime
+dependency changes from `@example/legacy` to `@example/core`, while `@example/core` retains its
+event-sink dependency on `@example/app`.
+
+### Module responsibilities and dependencies
+
+| Unit | Responsibility | Status |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `@example/app` | Delegates shared input validation to `@example/core`. | Changed |
+| `@example/core` | Provides the shared input validation used by `@example/app` and retains its event-sink dependency on `@example/app`. | Responsibility stays in place; receives the added incoming edge |
+| `@example/legacy` | No responsibility remains in the current two-package workspace. | Removed |
+
+- Added runtime edge: `@example/app → @example/core`.
+- Reverse edge: `@example/core → @example/app` was present in the base manifest and remains in
+  place, so the added edge completes a two-package dependency cycle.
+- Removed runtime edge: `@example/app → @example/legacy`.
+- Reverse edge: `@example/legacy → @example/app` was not present in the base manifest and is not
+  present in the current workspace.
+- No other runtime dependency edges were added or removed.
